# Generated local ledger — the autonomous heartbeat appends one tx per cycle
# (see src/meyasu/methods/autorun.clj). Deterministic output of data/seed.edn, not
# an event record; it stays on the machine that ran it, like every sibling
# observatory (watari / kakaku / sukashi / meisai). manifest/observatories.edn
# registers meyasu with :output-gitignored true — this line is what makes that true.
